ometres Pursuit, Men"] "\n" [:option {:value "923485"} "15 kilometres Mass Start, Men"] "\n" [:option {:value "923481"} "20 kilometres, Men"] "\n" [:option {:value "923486"} "4 × 7.5 kilometres Relay, Men"] "\n" [:option {:value "923490"} "7.5 kilometres Sprint, Women"] "\n" [:option {:value "923492"} "10 kilometres Pursuit, Women"] "\n" [:option {:value "923495"} "12.5 kilometres Mass Start, Women"] "\n" [:option {:value "923496"} "4 × 6 kilometres Relay, Women"]] [:script {} "$('#same_games_select').change(function(){location.href='/results/' + $('#same_games_select').val();})"]] " | " [:form {:class "form-inline form-inline-header"} [:select {:name "id", :id "other_games_select", :class "form-control"} [:option {:value ""} "In other Games"] "\n" [:option {:value "1557"} "1992"] "\n" [:option {:value "1568"} "1994"] "\n" [:option {:value "1580"} "1998"] "\n" [:option {:value "1593"} "2002"] "\n" [:option {:value "1608"} "2006"] "\n" [:option {:value "350030"} "2014"] "\n" [:option {:value "9000228"} "2018"] "\n" [:option {:value "19019638"} "2022"] "\n" [:option {:value "15000038"} "2026"]] [:script {} "$('#other_games_select').change(function(){location.href='/results/' + $('#other_games_select').val();})"]] " | " [:a {:href "/event_names/136"} "Event type"]] [:h1 {:class "event_title"} "15 kilometres, Women" [:small {}]] [:table {:class "biodata"} [:tbody {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Date"] [:td {} "18 February 2010 — 1:00"]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Status"] [:td {} "Olympic"]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Location"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/venues/181"} "Whistler Olympic Park, Whistler"]]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Participants"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/events/923491"} "87 from 31 countries"]]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Format"] [:td {:colspan "2"} "One-minute penalty for each missed target."]] [:tr {} [:th {:valign "top"} "Details"] [:td {} "Course Length: 14,830 m" [:br {}] "Height Differential: 40 m" [:br {}] "Maximum Climb: 41 m" [:br {}] "Shooting 1: Prone at 3.0 km, 50 m range" [:br {}] "Shooting 2: Standing at 6.0 km, 50 m range" [:br {}] "Shooting 3: Prone at 9.0 km, 50 m range" [:br {}] "Shooting 4: Standing at 12.0 km, 50 m range" [:br {}] "Total Climbing: 535 m"]]]] [:div {:class "description"} [:p {} "The 15 kilometres event was one that favoured both the very early and very late starters. " [:a {:href "/athletes/110008"} "Tora Berger"] " of Norway, starting second, skied a fast time of 40:52.8, and hit the  first nineteen out of the twenty targets she shot at. A miss on her last target meant that the wait for another 85 biathletes to compete would be more nerve wracking. Other early pace setters were " [:a {:href "/athletes/101168"} "Oksana Khvostenko"] "  of Ukraine starting 3rd (she would eventually finish 8th) and Kazakh " [:a {:href ""} "Elena Khrustaleva"] " starting 7th who missed none of her targets to finish in a time of 41:13.5. These times were enough for Berger and Khrustaleva the gold and silver medal respectively. Eventually coming through to take the bronze medal was " [:a {:href "/athletes/118516"} "Darya Domracheva"] " of Belarus who finished comfortably in bronze medal position. Berger’s win meant that Norway became the first nation to win 100 gold medals in the Winter Olympics. The fastest skiing time again belonged to " [:a {:href "/athletes/118546"} "Magdalena Neuner"] " but this time the German returned to her more erratic shooting form and missed three targets. Two notable absentees were the Russian pair of multiple world and Olympic medallist " [:a {:href "/athletes/99555"} "Albina Akhatova"] " and 2008 world champion Ekaterina Iourieva. Both were banned for their part in a doping scandal."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "Adjusted Time"] [:th {} "Misses"] [:th {} "Skiing"] [:th {} "Shooting 1 Misses"] [:th {} "Shooting 1"] [:th {} "Shooting 2 Misses"] [:th {} "Shooting 2"] [:th {} "Shooting 3 Misses"] [:th {} "Shooting 3"] [:th {} "Shooting 4 Mis